      "writtenOn": "2020-01-08T17:09:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand how you want try_src to work but I don\u0027t think we need override_on. From my understanding, override_try_src allows the state machine to turn on/off try_src (set/clear try_src_enable).\n\nSo if override_try_src is OFF, the state machine can\u0027t turn it on and try_src is turned off it\u0027s currently on. and if override_try_src is NO_OVERRIDE then the state machine is free to turn on/off try src.\n\nAlso, the current api only allows for override_try_src to be set to 2-values.",
      "parentUuid": "179ec7d5_20d78dc6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 100,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 108,
        "endChar": 46
